OL,3,GNEWSATeen who died suddenly inspires
OL,4,Afirst aid lessons
OL,5,
OL,6,FTeammates of a teenager who died
OL,7,Fsuddenly from a brain haemorrhage have
OL,8,Fgathered to learn first aid skills in
OL,9,Fher memory.
OL,11,FLidia Connolly, 19, from
OL,12,FStourport-on-Severn in Worcestershire,
OL,13,Fdied in May after being found
OL,14,Funresponsive at a friend's party.
OL,16,FShe was the "life and soul" of Young
OL,17,FGloves Karate in Kidderminster, founder
OL,18,FJustin Thomas said, as the club held a
OL,19,Flife-saving awareness course including
OL,20,Fhow to use a defibrillator and
OL,21,Fadminister CPR.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
