OL,3,GNEWSATeen who died suddenly inspires
OL,4,Afirst aid lessons
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Losing Lidia was a massive shock, this
OL,7,Fwas a 19-year-old with all her life to
OL,8,Flive, it was just so sudden," said
OL,9,FThomas.
